&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191055/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Balance build time with your time&lt;/a&gt; - Our technologists do meaningful work, and we give them the support to have a meaningful life, too.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;🟨 Our &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191056/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;weekly JavaScript newsletter&lt;/a&gt; shares cool projects, news, and articles with over 150,000 developers.&lt;/p&gt;
