&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190752/rss" title="blog.alena.rocks" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;The Periodic Table of HTML Elements&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — Contains all 115 elements of the current HTML Living Standard. A modernization of Josh Duck’s version &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190753/rss" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;included in&lt;/a&gt; Brad Frost’s Atomic Design book.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alena Batitskaia &lt;/p&gt;
