&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190094/rss" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/cpress/image/upload/w_1280,e_sharpen:60,q_auto/v1788956475/jeuulzv6w370u4trtjib.png" width="640" style="    line-height: 100%;      "&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 18px;"&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190094/rss" title="www.drawably.dev" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;Drawably: Hand-Drawn UI Controls&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — A collection of neat hand-drawn UI controls. The animated pen sketches even get drawn via seeded randomness. Zero dependencies, ~7 KB of JS gzipped and a 3 KB stylesheet. &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190095/rss" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;Repo here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Daniel White &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 18px;"&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190096/rss" title="vgpu.sh" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;vgpu: Render WebGPU Shaders in the Browser or Node.js&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — Provides a way to use the same shader in the browser or render headlessly with Node (to a high-resolution PNG or MP4 video). WGSL modules import and export like TypeScript does.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vercel &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 18px;"&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190097/rss" title="try.expo.dev" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;Sentry Says It Crashed. Datadog Says It's Slow. Expo Tells You Why&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — Expo Observe knows your release pipeline, so it ties a startup regression to the exact build or update that caused it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expo &lt;span style="text-transform: uppercase; margin-left: 4px; font-size: 0.9em;   color: #997 !important; padding: 1px 4px; "&gt;sponsor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 18px;"&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190098/rss" title="wcagtoolkit.com" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;WCAG Radar: Run Accessibility Checks on Pages You Have Open&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — A bookmarklet and browser extension that runs WCAG 2.1 and 2.2 AA checks against the page you’re on and marks up the results in place, all running locally. &lt;em&gt;Note: 28 of the checks are free, but you get 18 additional checks with a paid upgrade.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proper Access B.V. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 18px;"&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190099/rss" title="github.com" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;Roux: A Boilerplate of Pre-Defined Native CSS Styling&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — This HTML/CSS starter provides a foundation of CSS files, variables, base styles, and HTML components. You can see it in action on &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190100/rss" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;the docs page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;thoughtbot &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 18px;"&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190101/rss" title="fixiproject.org" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;The Fixi Project: A Collection of Small Web Libraries by the Creators of htmx&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — All five libraries – each one a standalone script – are designed to be lightweight versions of their more popular offerings like htmx, Hyperscript, Idiomorph, etc. &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/190102/rss" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;Source code&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Big Sky Software &lt;/p&gt;
